</mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c36\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-tstrut></mjx-tstrut></mjx-mtd></mjx-mtr></mjx-itable></mjx-table></mjx-mtable></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mtable displaystyle=\"true\" columnalign=\"right left\" columnspacing=\"0em\" rowspacing=\"0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.8em 0.3em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></menclose><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></menclose></mfrac></mstyle><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></menclose><mo>⋅</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><menclose notation=\"updiagonalstrike\"><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></menclose></mfrac></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>m</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>We now have a linear equation in <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"11\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45A TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> and we can solve this using the addition and multiplication principles:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"12\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style